# Maxie's POKéMON still in their balls come in with 1 HP (gParties[B_TRAINER_OPPONENT_A] at +0x258, slots 1–3, hp at
# +0x56): mashed, Mega Camerupt's burns could wear the boosted lead down over his whole team and lose the battle
until @gMain+4 4 @@BattleMainCB2 20000 A 24
poke @gParties+312 1
poke @gParties+313 0
poke @gParties+376 1
poke @gParties+377 0
poke @gParties+3DA 1
poke @gParties+3DB 0
